<title>FINLAND: KEMIRA ACQUIRES FULL OWNERSHIP OF SSV-SAILONTA.</title>
<headline>KEMIRA ACQUIRES FULL OWNERSHIP OF SSV-SAILONTA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish chemicals group Kemira Oy said in a statement on Thursday it had acquired full ownership of SSV-Sailonta Oy, a packager of silage additives, from Finnish dairy group Valio Oy.</p>
<p>&quot;SSV-Sailonta, which has been co-owned by Valio and Kemira Chemicals, will now become fully owned by Kemira,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Kemira did not give any financial details of the deal.</p>
<p>SSV's turnover will be about 25 million markka in 1997.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
